### 3.10 Tests (mandatory)

New files under `test/agent_foundation/ui/`:

| Test | What it asserts |
|------|-----------------|
| `test_widget_protocol_roundtrip.py` | `WidgetMessage.from_dict(m.to_dict()) == m` for every `widget_type` in `WIDGET_TYPES`. |
| `test_input_modes_roundtrip.py` | `InputModeConfig` round-trip including `ChoiceOption.description` and the `'multiple_choices'` legacy alias. |
| `test_interactive_base_async.py` | `await base.aget_input()` returns what `base.get_input()` returns (using a stub subclass). Same for `asend_response`. |
| `test_interactive_checkpoint_runs.py` | The previously-latent async bug: actually run `interactive_checkpoint.run_checkpoint(...)` against the stub subclass; assert no `AttributeError`. |
| `test_web_interactive_basic.py` | Construct `WebUIInteractive`; push an input; assert `aget_input()` returns it. Assert `supports_widgets is True`. |

