**Goal:** Stand up `react-shared/` with the *low-risk pure primitives*
moved into it. After Phase 1 the AF demo app builds and runs against the
library; OS and RE are untouched.

### 4.1 Bootstrap

Create `AgentFoundation/src/agent_foundation/ui/react-shared/`:

