These are the components with the smallest blast radius: pure primitives
that have **no** widget protocol coupling and minimal divergence.

From `AgentFoundation/.../webui/react/src/components/common/`:
- `EmptyState.js`, `LoadingIndicator.js`, `PersonChip.js`,
