From AF hooks:
- `useFileViewer.js`, `useContextMenu.js`, `useInputFields.js`,
  `useSectionVisibility.js`, `useProgressHeader.js`.

**Critical reconciliation in this phase:**

1. **`MarkdownRenderer.js`** — start from AF's version, then:
   - Fix `theme.custom.surfaces.*` → `theme?.custom?.surfaces?.*` with
     graceful fallbacks. (Verified ground-truth: AF currently crashes if
     `custom` is missing.)
