     normalization (lines 160–174 of OS's file).
   - Standardize on `react-markdown` v9 + `remark-gfm` v4 +
     `react-syntax-highlighter` v15 (now library deps, not host deps).
2. **`ThemeProvider.js`** — already has `createThemeFn` prop (verified).
   No change needed; just move it. Document the MUI 5/7 cross-version
