## 6. Phase 3 — Extended primitives & hooks (target: 1 week)

**Goal:** Move the second tier of reusable components (chat, layout,
progress, graph, hooks) into `react-shared/`.

### 6.1 Components added in Phase 3

| Bucket | Items |
|--------|-------|
| `chat/` | `ChatInput`, `ChatMessage`, `StreamingMessage` (reconcile from 3 forks), `CommandAutocomplete`, `Breadcrumb` (from OS), `ThinkingFold` (from OS, generalized), `PromptViewerDrawer` (from OS), `AgentMessageBubble` (from OS). |
| `layout/` | `AppHeader` (reconcile AF/RE), `FileViewer` (reconcile 3 forks), `ConnectionStatusBar` (from OS, generalized), `FolderTree` (from OS). |
| `progress/` | `ProgressSection`, `CompletedSection`, `TaskProgressBar`, `TaskProgressPanel` (reconcile AF/RE). |
| `graph/` | `GraphFlowView` (from OS), `NodeDetailPanel` (from OS). |
| `messages/` | `PreMessage` (reconcile AF/RE). |
| `queries/` | `QueryCard`, `EditableList` (renamed from `EditableQueryList`), `AddDropdown` (generic) — `AddQueriesDropdown` stays in app as a thin wrapper. |
| `actions/` | `SuggestedActions` (reconcile AF/RE). |
| `hooks/` | `useChat`, `useAgentChat` (with `messageAdapter` prop for RE), `useAgentWebSocket` (with `messageAdapter` prop). |

### 6.2 LIFT-AND-GENERALIZE items (require careful refactor)

| Item | What changes |
|------|--------------|
| `useProgress` | Today RE-shape-specific. Extract `useProgress({ items, completedPredicate, sortFn })` primitive. RE wraps it. |
| `useWorkspace` | Today `/api/workspace/*` shape-specific. Extract a `useWorkspace({ fetchTree, fetchFile })` primitive that takes fetchers as props. |
| `AgentStatusBar` | Decompose into `<ConnectionStatus>`, `<ModelSelector>`, `<TargetPathChip>` primitives in `common/`. Apps re-compose. |
| `AgentStreamDrawer` | Extract a `<StreamDrawer>` shell; apps supply content. |
| `AgentStreamSection` | Extract a `<CollapsibleStreamSection>` shell. |
| `PendingReasonPopover` (OS) | Generalize: expose `resolutions[]` + `onResolve(reason, value)` as props (drop the OpenTEAM-specific resolution map). |
| `BackendSelector` (OS) | Extract a `<ModelSelector value options onChange />` primitive (Reuses the one created for AgentStatusBar). |

### 6.3 Items that stay in apps (KEEP-IN-APP)

These have unavoidable domain coupling. Apps keep their copy; we
extract only the underlying primitives:

- **OS**: `SessionContextBar`, `Sidebar` (the OpenTEAM session/task one),
  `SettingsDrawer`, `TaskCard`, `TaskPanel`, plus every component under
  `components/employees|projects|tasks|teams|views/`, plus
  `useGraphState`, `useManagerChat`, `usePromptViewer`,
  `useServerBackends`, `useTaskTopologies`.
- **RE**: every `components/hub/*` and `components/views/*`, plus
  `ProposalSelectionWidget`, `MultiViewTaskPanel`, `PipelineStatusBar`,
  plus all RE-specific hooks (`useAutopilot`, `useComboOverrides`,
  `useProposalOverrides`, `useSubmissionTemplates`, `useViewWorkspace`,
  `useHypothesisImplementations`, `useAggregationSettings`,
  `useArchiveCount`).
- **AF demo**: app-specific session/workspace contexts.

### 6.4 Phase 3 exit criteria

- All Phase-3 components live in `react-shared/src/` and ship in `dist/`.
- AF demo app uses no local copy of any promoted component.
- Snapshot tests green; Storybook covers every promoted item.

