## 11. Sequence & timeline

```
Week 1:   Phase 0  — Python contract (3 days) + Phase 1 (3 days, in parallel after Phase 0 day 1)
Week 2:   Phase 2  — Widget protocol canonicalization
Week 3:   Phase 3  — Extended primitives & hooks
Week 4–5: Phase 4a — RankEvolve migration (Python first, then React)
Week 4–5: Phase 4b — OpenStartup migration (React only)  ← parallelizable with 4a
Week 6:   Phase 4c — AF demo cleanup + Phase 5 (CI guardrails, governance)
Ongoing:  Phase 5  — drift audits, releases
```

**Critical path:** Phase 0 → Phase 1 → Phase 2 → Phase 4a (RE Python).
Everything else can fan out.

