### Appendix B — Glossary

- **AF** — AgentFoundation.
- **OS** — OpenStartup / OpenTEAM.
- **RE** — RankEvolve.
- **Wire protocol** — JSON shape sent over WebSocket between Python
  backend and React frontend; defined by `widget_protocol.WidgetMessage`.
- **Built-in widget** — one of the 12 widget types in
  `widget_protocol.WIDGET_TYPES`; ships in `react-shared`.
- **Domain widget** — any widget that names a domain concept
  (`SprintProgress`, `ProposalSelection`, …); stays in its app and
  registers via `registerWidget('namespace.type', Component)`.

### Appendix C — File-by-file extraction map (collapsed view)

See Section 9 for the full matrix. Phase ordering ensures each batch
is a self-contained PR.

